    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No.6 Skylark Way, Saint Marnock’s Bay, a beautifully presented 3 bedroom end of terrace in this highly sought after family friendly estate. The property offers style, comfort, and energy efficiency. \r\nThe property briefly comprises of entrance hall with w.c., lounge, kitchen and dining area, and utility room. On the first floor there are 3 spacious bedrooms, master bedroom ensuite and a large family bathroom. The rear garden is walled and fenced with a gated side passage. \r\n\r\nSituated near Portmarnock DART Station, ensuring fast access to the City Centre and the 102-bus route to the Swords Pavillon Shopping Centre and Dublin Airport.  There are a host of amenities close by including the Velvet Strand & Promenade, the breath-taking coastal walk from Portmarnock to Baldoyle, the Sports and Leisure Centre and nearby shopping facilities include Centra and Lidl.  There are excellent primary and secondary schools within easy walking distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t5.7 x 1.3\tDecorative timber floor, recessed lighting\r\n\r\nW.C.\t1.7 x 1.58\tTiled floor, wall tiling, w.c., w.h.b., recessed lighting\r\n\r\n\r\nLounge\t3.9 x 3.8\tDecorative timber flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen\t3.35 x 5.38\tDecorative timber floor, fully fitted units, fridge freezer, oven, hob, extractor fan, bin storage, dishwasher, under cabinet lights.\r\n\r\nUtility\t0.7 x 1.95\tPlumbed for washing machine \r\n\r\nFirst Floor\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\nStairs/Landing\t\tDecorative timber floor, banister feature lighting \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t4.17 x 2.93\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t2.3 x 3.75\tDecorative timber floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t3.75 x 3.3\tDecorative timber floor, double fitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nEnsuite\t1.74 x 2.48\tHeated rail, under sink storage, w.c., w.h.b., shower, wall and floor tiling\r\n\r\nStorage\t1.08 x 1.73\tDecorative timber floor\r\n\r\nBathroom\t2.5 x 1.7\tFitted under sink storage, heated rail, w.c., w.h.b., bath and screen, shower, recessed lighting, floor and wall tiling\r\n\r\nGarden\tFence and wall, patio, side entrance"
      },
